Changes for 7.0.0rc1

New features:
[ZBXNEXT-9168] replaced the software license with AGPL-3.0-only (Sasha)
[ZBXNEXT-9039] added Go compiler version to Zabbix agent 2 plugin version output (mprihodko)
[ZBX-24210] improve new conn creation concurrency, bump plugin support version (rzvejs)

Bug fixes:
[ZBX-24186] added support of arm64 to Makefile (mprihodko)
[ZBX-24278] improved PostgreSQL autovacuum's count query (abrosimovs)

